    - target: {fileID: 6380436179282662226, guid: 76354cb641cf5aa46ba4902d9b7024f7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<font="bold">''s-Hertogenbosch </font>is a railway station located
        in ''s-Hertogenbosch in North Brabant, Netherlands.

        The station
        is an important interchange station, with trains coming from several different
        directions. <font="bold">''s-Hertogenbosch </font>was the only Dutch station
        which provided in Auto-Train services. Services ran into Avignon, Bologna
        and Livorno. Auto-Trains were operated by Euro-Express-Traincharter. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
